Z||000000||bcwawright||05-20-2001||08:22 PM||||Does anyone know of a source for an under drive pulley(2.8) other than the Fiero Store.<BR>I am trying to build a show car and the one from the Fiero Store is painted steel and I was wanting something in an anodized aluminum......if no one knows where I can get this maybe you know of a cheaper source for the one like the Fiero Store sells.<BR>Thanks<P>Bruce<BR>88GT||||reg||5
